"""A "body" detector for layer 0's MLP output, component 1487 (negative-going).

The component writes a strongly negative value into the residual stream whenever the
current token is the word "body" or one of its forms: " body", "Body", "bodies", "-body",
"/body", "bodily", and code identifiers ending in Body (ResponseBody, Rigidbody). The same
idea in other languages gives a similar negative value: 身体, 體, 体, 身, 人体, 肉体, 全身,
