(a code keyword), "somebody"/"everybody"/"anybody"/"nobody", and "physical", "solid", "flesh",
"torso", "corpus", "embodied". The token after "body" is also negative when it is " of"
("body of evidence"). Every other position is predicted as 0.

Activations are negative wherever the rule fires, so the program predicts negative numbers.
The magnitudes are rough per-word averages measured on training text.
"""
READS = ()

BODY_WORDS = {"body", "bodies", "bodily", "bod"}
BODY_OTHER_LANGUAGES = {"身体", "身體", "体", "體", "身", "人体", "肉体", "全身", "身材", "一体",
                        "体内", "körper", "corps", "corpo", "cuerpo", "체", "躯", "尸体", "thể"}
VOID_AND_NOBODY_WORDS = {"somebody", "everybody", "anybody", "nobody", "void"}
PHYSICAL_WORDS = {"physical", "physically", "physique", "solid", "solids", "flesh", "torso",
                  "corpus", "corporal", "embodied", "embody", "embodies", "corpse"}


def _clean(token):
    return token.strip().lower().strip("-./()_")


