"""Layer-0 MLP down_proj component 1489: a weak, mostly-diffuse signal.

It is not a clean feature. Its activation is small noise (std 0.03) whose mean
depends only loosely on coarse token classes and on how early in its document
the token sits. This program predicts a few class means:

- tokens at the first two positions of a document: slightly positive;
- letters from non-Latin scripts (CJK, Cyrillic, Arabic, Thai, Hangul, ...):
  slightly positive;
- Latin-letter word pieces that continue a word (no leading space): slightly negative;
- Latin words that start with a space: about zero.

All other tokens predict 0.
