work working together contact interact comply familiar equipped conjunction
association connected combined filled coupled linked compatible agree agreed
agreement accordance communicate communicating provided provide cope coping
struggle struggling'''.split())
COMPARISON_AS = set('''such well same long far soon much good known used
use defined written served serves serve act acts treated represented regarded
expressed'''.split())
