for falls, rises and trends have negative ones. Inflections and word-start
formatting alter their strength. Motion phrases keep a negative response on
'in'; 'record of' and 'fall of' echo the preceding word. Storage and
persistence terms have smaller positive responses. Other tokens are nearly
zero. State is the previous word and base response, reset at document boundaries.
